      "solution": "Gọi tấm bìa hình vuông là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cạnh <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm, đáy hình chóp là hình vuông <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cạnh <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cm có tâm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có đường chéo <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, chiều cao hình chóp sau khi gấp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tThể tích khối chóp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tXét <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> cm.<br>\n\t\tVậy thể tích hộp quà lớn nhất khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.",
